  description: 123123123123123
  title: Arithmetic Instructions
  content: 'Lesson 2: Arithmetic Instructions

    Objective: Learn how to perform
    simple arithmetic.

    

    Instructions Covered:

    ADD and SUB: Adds
    or subtracts values between registers.

    MOV AL, 3

    ADD AL, 5      ;
    AL = 8

    SUB AL, 2      ; AL = 6

    

    Exercise Application: These
    are used in Exercise 1 (Byte Bug) and Exercise 2 (Binary Bat).

'
